        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) APRA may extend the period for deciding an application covered by paragraph (1)(a) or (b) by up to 30 days if APRA informs the body corporate, or a member of the group, that made the.application of the extension:",
            "block_bbox": [
                258,
                153,
                992,
                261
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) in writing, and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                319,
                271,
                524,
                293
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) within 90 days after receiving the application..",
            "block_bbox": [
                316,
                302,
                854,
                327
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) If APRA extends the period for deciding the application, it must decide the application within the extended period.",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                349,
                991,
                401
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) If APRA has not decided the application by the end of the period.by which it is required to decide the application, APRA is taken to.have decided, at the end of the last day of that period, to refuse the.application.\n",
